FROM python:3.15.1-slim-trixie@sha256:533b0b2f9b5d46fd097091cf826f27902f1d6c3bca714b6dc74551356aa97a51 AS python-sdk
FROM gcc:16.2.0-trixie@sha256:3f73339bf0d3d64081cac3f6d9fdafc6dd4cef2b9c49e0a09f91e97cb0eb139a
COPY --from=python-sdk /usr/local/ /usr/local/
RUN apt-get update && DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get upgrade -y \
    && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
       ca-certificates pkgconf libtool asciidoctor bc bison flex gettext \
       libaudit-dev libcap-ng-dev libcrypt-dev libcryptsetup-dev libncurses-dev \
       libpam0g-dev libreadline-dev libselinux-dev libsqlite3-dev libsystemd-dev \
       libudev-dev netbase socat systemd-dev zlib1g-dev \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/* \
    && groupadd --gid 10001 source-build \
    && useradd --uid 10001 --gid source-build --no-create-home --shell /bin/sh source-build
USER 10001:10001
ENV HAI_DISPOSABLE_NATIVE_SOURCE_SDK=1 HOME=/build/home TMPDIR=/build/tmp
ENTRYPOINT ["python", "-I", "/inputs/build_source.py"]
